integrated from minus infinity to :attr:`input`, elementwise.

.. math::
    \text{log\_ndtr}(x) = \log\left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{2 \pi}}\int_{-\infty}^{x} e^{-\frac{1}{2}t^2} dt \right)


